We are gonna be big

00:00:53.129 --> 00:00:55.609
Edison says he's months away from lighting up the world

00:00:56.699 --> 00:01:03.018
Stoves, washing machines, electric carriages. I could do the same thing with electricity that I do with gas

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:08.280
Westinghouse Electric Company.
 Edison Electric it has to be

